          <td><span class="postbody">No expansion is critical, first off.  
<br />

<br />
The Shrouded Isles (SI) expansion is the one to get, as it doubles the amount of space to run around it, plus the new areas are better xp.  Trials of Atlantis is not needed at all until level 50.  Before that time its only effect is a graphics upgrade.  All substantive content is level 50 oriented, with the exception of 3 additional player races, which nobody seems to be playing.
<br />

<br />
SI can be found pretty cheap, certainly no more than $19.95 (the high end), or for less.</span><span class="gensmall"><i></i></span></td>
